> I have tested it and there was a bug in the function due to missing leading zeros for months 1-9 (Jan-Sep) that should have been 01-09. In download.R, line 129 can be replaced with the following to fix the bug: destination[[counter]] <- sprintf("%d%02d.mbox", year, month)

https://github.com/sailuh/kaiaulu/blob/ce80284b725b7ad2910e504c6c6a8c4ab1065436/R/download.R#L129

@CorneJB One more @tuejari found. Did you by any chance run into this one? I know I own you a commit on the required columns of parse_mbox so it doesn't get angry with the pipermail downloader for having less fields 😓 

@tuejari thanks again for catching these!

